<title>SOUTH KOREA: Kyungnam Energy plans 1-for-2 bonus.</title>
<headline>Kyungnam Energy plans 1-for-2 bonus.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1996-11-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Korea's Kyungnam Energy Co Ltd plans to offer a 1-for-2 bonus issue in December, raising its paid-in capital to 14.66 billion won from the current 9.78 billion, a company statement said on Friday.  </p>
<p>Kyungnam Energy will issue 977,500 common shares and offer them to its shareholders registered as of December 30, the statement said.</p>
<p>Kyungnam Energy shares closed at a limit high of 48,600 won on Friday, up 3,600.</p>
<p>--Seoul Newsroom (822) 727 5643</p>
